	<key>PayloadDescription</key>
	<string>Adds a TH Planner icon to your Home Screen that opens the full planner in a browser tab, with your school sign-in. Nothing else on your phone is changed. To remove it, delete this profile in Settings › General › VPN &amp; Device Management.</string>
